bability ve\n','ctor ? disease label\n- Output: Predicted disease + advisory recommendation\n- Design: Arrows connecting each stage, icons for camera, gears (processing), brain (CNN), and mobile phone (output).\n\n\n- Mobile-based CNN system for crop disease detection.\n- Focus on six major crops using PlantVillage dataset.\n- Lightweight models (MobileNetV2, EfficientNet-B0) optimized for Android.\n- Offline functionality ensures accessibility in rural Ghana.\n- Advisory recommendations empower farmers to reduce losses and improve sustainability.\n\n\n- AI-driven mobile solutions can revolutionize agriculture in Ghana.\n- The proposed system is Specific, Measurable, Achievable, Relevant, and Time-bound (SMART).\n- Expected to reduce crop losses (~19.3%) and strengthen food security.\n- Provides scalable, farmer-friendly technology for rural communities.\n- Future scope: expand dataset coverage, integrate severity analysis, and extend to more crops.\n\n\n\n\n?? SMART Framing\n- Specific: Six crops, CNN-based mobile app, offline advisory.\n- Measurable: Accuracy ? 90%, latency ? 1s per image, farmer adoption rate tracked.\n- Achievable: Lightweight models (MobileNetV2, EfficientNet-B0) proven feasible on Android.\n- Relevant: Addresses GhanaÆs 19.3% crop loss challenge.\n- Time-bound: 6-month phased timeline (dataset ? training ? app ? testing ? deployment).\n\n?? Prince, I can now design the actual slides with visuals (charts for dataset distribution, CNN workflow diagram, Ghana crop loss stats, and system architecture flow). Do you want me to prepare those diagrams and layouts so you can present directly?\n\nDataset Overview: Total Images: 87,867,Training Set: 70,295 images (80%),Validation Set: 17,572 images (20%)\n','A1tLNjkatWQRZeHU+2gyWQ==','','263.0','0xee0a3ec840f1fc67bcea090700c926cf07703a07488b96ab4bca6917db7b9053'),(3,'2','sikapa','0+soiTtW+Zc2r+aFoOmNMLK3nRVSDy9sf22sXy+MHSc=','MtKwqsa9cs1NC12OsMrpeA==','2026/08/23 19:53:24','hi','hi.txt','hello \n','825T5